<h1 style="font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#742a2a;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">⚠️ Workspace Not Yet Active</h1>
<p style="color:#718096;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 24px;">
  Hello <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>, we received your payment for the <strong>{{plan}}</strong> plan,
  but our system was unable to complete workspace provisioning automatically.
</p>

<div class="alert-danger">
  <strong>What happened:</strong> Your payment was confirmed, but provisioning your isolated tenant schema
  encountered an error: <em>{{failureReason}}</em>.
</div>

<table class="info-table">
  <tr><td>Company</td><td>{{companyName}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Plan</td><td><strong>{{plan}}</strong></td></tr>
  <tr><td>Date</td><td>{{failureDate}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h3 style="font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#2d3748;margin:28px 0 12px;">What happens next</h3>
<ul style="color:#4a5568;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;padding-left:20px;">
  <li><strong>We retry automatically.</strong> Our platform will attempt provisioning again on the next
      payment-webhook retry and on the scheduled reconciliation cycle.</li>
  <li><strong>You can retry now.</strong> If you'd like to kick off provisioning immediately, return to your
      billing page and retry the activation.</li>
  <li><strong>No further charges.</strong> You will not be charged again until your workspace is active.</li>
</ul>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:28px 0;">
  <a href="{{retryUrl}}" class="button" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00A3B5,#007A8C);">Retry Activation →</a>
</div>

<p style="color:#4a5568;font-size:14px;text-align:center;">
  Need help? Contact us at
  <a href="mailto:support@sentinelfi.com" style="color:#00A3B5;">support@sentinelfi.com</a>
  {{#if supportUrl}} or visit our <a href="{{supportUrl}}" style="color:#00A3B5;">support center</a>.{{/if}}
</p>